# Choke 0: a 13 x 13 x 10 mm power choke, 3.25 m long, 3.25 m wide and 2.5 m tall (250 times life size): a rounded dark grey ferrite block with a shallow dish on top
# (pc_inductor_grey) and a copper terminal on two opposite sides (pc_copper). Tall blocker: convex collider.
format 1
collider convex

# A rounded block with a dish cut into the top and two terminal plates
Detail detail=0.48
    Union
        Material material=pc_inductor_grey
            Subtraction
                Translate translation=(0, 1.25, 0)
                    RoundBox size=(1.5, 1.25, 1.625) roundness=0.45
                Translate translation=(0, 2.5, 0)
                    Ellipsoid radii=(1, 0.25, 1)
        Material material=pc_copper
            SymmetryX
                Translate translation=(1.56, 0.65, 0)
                    RoundBox size=(0.065, 0.65, 1.05) roundness=0.03
